{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"Only estimates. The core-air model uses a single-layer Wheeler estimate and is a rough guide when the winding diameter is less than the winding length 3×. This model avoids wire thickness, distance, near metal, frequency, parasitic capacitance and measurement conditions. For toroids, enter the AL factor from the appropriate core datasheet; AL and permeability can change with frequency, temperature, DC bias, gap and manufacturing tolerances. Verify any actual design with the core manufacturer and measurements.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"inductor-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["inductor-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Hanya perkiraan. Model inti-udara menggunakan perkiraan lapisan tunggal Wheeler dan merupakan panduan kasar ketika diameter lilitan kurang dari panjang lilitan ZXQPH0000QXZ×. Model ini menghindari ketebalan kawat, jarak, logam dekat, frekuensi, kapasitansi parasit dan kondisi pengukuran. Untuk toroid, masukkan faktor AL dari lembar data inti yang tepat; AL dan permeabilitas dapat berubah dengan frekuensi, suhu, bias DC, celah dan toleransi pembuatan. Verifikasi desain nyata apapun dengan produsen inti dan pengukuran.","record_id":"b668685e1fa3df31809eae158e3a76a4a37168a26269c0ebe16dd4c4300b36d1","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.6422785655,"source":"Estimate only. The air-core model uses Wheeler’s single-layer approximation and is a rough guide when coil diameter is less than 3× winding length. It omits wire thickness, spacing, nearby metal, frequency, parasitic capacitance and measurement conditions. For a toroid, enter the AL factor from its exact core datasheet; AL and permeability can change with frequency, temperature, DC bias, gap and manufacturing tolerance. Verify any real design with the core manufacturer and measurement.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"afb560136b551f41a3012376f29e0acf944d00215a9916e516e2d603237c8159","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Hanya perkiraan. Model inti-udara menggunakan perkiraan lapisan tunggal Wheeler dan merupakan panduan kasar ketika diameter lilitan kurang dari panjang lilitan 3×. Model ini menghindari ketebalan kawat, jarak, logam dekat, frekuensi, kapasitansi parasit dan kondisi pengukuran. Untuk toroid, masukkan faktor AL dari lembar data inti yang tepat; AL dan permeabilitas dapat berubah dengan frekuensi, suhu, bias DC, celah dan toleransi pembuatan. Verifikasi desain nyata apapun dengan produsen inti dan pengukuran.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
